## 3. THIRD-PARTY DATA PROVENANCE & ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

- **Lorenz63 & Rössler Data:** Numerically generated using standard deterministic RK4 integration routines included in this repository.
- **Foreign Exchange and Cryptocurrency Data:** Historical daily exchange rates and cryptocurrency price series are sourced from public financial records (Yahoo Finance API).
- **Multilateral Lending Panel Data:** Derived from publicly disclosed annual loan approval portfolios of the Central American Bank for Economic Integration (BCIE Open Data).
- **Honduras Fuel Price Data:** Sourced from public weekly retail petroleum price bulletins published by the Secretaría de Energía de Honduras (SEN).
